This visual bug is caused by a well-known Flexbox CSS quirk. Because the outer screen box has justifyContent: "center", when the content grows taller than the screen, Flexbox forces it to stay perfectly centered, which actually clips the top and bottom and prevents you from scrolling to see the rest of it!
To fix this, we need to remove the centering from the parent box, put my: "auto" (margin-top/bottom auto) on the card itself (which centers it safely without breaking scroll), and add a little bit of bottom margin to the input box so it isn't touching the line.
Here is exactly what you need to replace:
### 1. Update jaStyles in your JournalStyle.js file
Find these two specific lines in your JournalStyle.js file and replace them with this updated version:
```javascript
  // REPLACE THESE TWO LINES:
  actionScreenBox: { p: 5, flexGrow: 1, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", animation: "fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out", backgroundColor: "#f8fafc", overflowY: "auto" },
  actionCard: { p: 4, width: "100%", maxWidth: 650, minHeight: 480, border: "1px solid", borderColor: "divider", borderRadius: 3, backgroundColor: "white", boxShadow: "0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)" },

  // WITH THIS (Removed justifyContent, added my: "auto" to the card):
  actionScreenBox: { p: 5, flexGrow: 1, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", alignItems: "center", animation: "fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out", backgroundColor: "#f8fafc", overflowY: "auto" },
  actionCard: { p: 4, width: "100%", maxWidth: 650, minHeight: 480, my: "auto", border: "1px solid", borderColor: "divider", borderRadius: 3, backgroundColor: "white", boxShadow: "0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1)" },

```
### 2. Update the TextField Box in VoucherAuthorization.jsx
Find the code block for the "New Execution Date & Time" input (around line 1618), and add mb: 2 (margin-bottom) so the card stretches a bit more at the bottom to give it breathing room.
**Replace this block:**
```javascript
                          {scheduleOverrideType === "OVERRIDE" && (
                            <Box
                              sx={{
                                mt: 2,
                                p: 2,
                                backgroundColor: "#f8fafc",
                                borderRadius: 2,
