                                // ... TextField props stay the same

```
**With this block:**
```javascript
                          {scheduleOverrideType === "OVERRIDE" && (
                            <Box
                              sx={{
                                mt: 2,
                                mb: 2, // <-- Added margin-bottom to fix the cutoff
                                p: 2,
                                backgroundColor: "#f8fafc",
                                borderRadius: 2,
                                border: "1px solid",
                                borderColor: "divider",
                                animation: "fadeIn 0.2s ease-in-out",
                              }}
                            >
                              <TextField
                                // ... TextField props stay the same

```
This will completely fix the cutoff issue and allow the modal to scroll perfectly all the way to the bottom!
